Package: gosnitch
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Robert McLeod <robert@penguinpower.co.nz>
Essential: no
Homepage: https://github.com/penguinpowernz/gosnitch
Installed-Size: 37475
Depends: libc6, libgl1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libwayland-client0, libffi8
Conflicts: opensnitch-ui
Description: Fyne system tray UI for the OpenSnitch application firewall
  gosnitch is a lightweight tray client for opensnitchd, offering a simpler
  alternative to the stock Python UI. It shows connection events in one plain
  table, lists and deletes rules, and prompts on unmatched connections with a
  button-only dialog designed to be answered without careful aiming.
